155
00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:44.390
Küla taludes süttivad tuled
ja uusi linnu.

156
00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.990
S. Ja.

157
00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.590
Aga muidugi oli ka neid abielumehi,
kes,

158
00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.620
