160
00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.425
Ametlik silmarõõm rühmas.

161
00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:13.600
Mul on selline au,
ajalooarhiivides olen mina esimese

162
00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.990
